		{
			dependencies: ["664F03BCD6779986"]
			description: [
				"   The &6Pulverizer&r has a slot next to the input that most people leave empty. Whatever goes there is a &6catalyst&r: it gets used up a bit at a time and, while it lasts, it changes the recipe. More main output, more by-products, less energy per run, depending on what you feed it."
				""
				"   It also makes outputs that otherwise don't exist. A few recipes here list a result at &a0%&r: &6Obsidianite&r from obsidian dust, rutile and ilmenite from the clusters. Every catalyst sets a floor, a minimum chance for every output, and that floor is the only reason those ever drop. Multipliers don't help there; zero times anything is still zero. &cWithout a catalyst, obsidian dust goes in and nothing comes out.&r"
				""
				"   &6Quartz Dust&r is the cheap one: &a1.1×&r main output, &a85%&r energy, a &a5%&r floor, and it's spent &a85%&r of the time. That's about seventeen dusts per Obsidianite. Enough to get started, and the reason the rest of this column exists."
				""
				"&7&o— Seventeen to one. Remember that number when the next catalyst looks expensive.&r&r"
			]
			id: "377D66DD47488FE4"
			shape: "hexagon"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5601627FBBA59813"
				item: "mekanism:dust_quartz"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Abrasive Efficiency"
			x: -3.5d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["377D66DD47488FE4"]
			description: [
				"   Everyone treats the &6Pulverizer&r like a rock blender. It's a slot machine, and catalysts are how you load the dice."
				""
				"   &6Coke Dust&r loads them for speed and leftovers: &a1.5×&r secondary output, never below a &a35%&r chance, &a30%&r of the normal energy per run. It also burns through itself, gone &a60%&r of the time."
				""
				"   So it's not for hoarding rare dusts (that's &6Rich Slag&r, patient and boring). It's for when a line of raw ore is backing up and you want it cleared, with a little extra on the way out."
				""
				"&7&o— Fast, greedy and short-lived. Sounds like most of my ideas.&r&r"
			]
			id: "25FED667BD6B99AD"
			shape: "gear"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6FD3BD75DC351BD3"
				item: "immersiveengineering:dust_coke"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Reactive Combustion"
			x: -5.0d
			y: -2.0d
		}
